@startuml engine_activity

skinparam backgroundColor #D3D3D3
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI

|Caller|
|Dispatcher|
|Handler|
|ModelBuilder|

|Caller|
start
:Submit ModelCommand;

|Dispatcher|
:Look up handler\nin dispatch table;
:Delegate to Handler;

|Handler|
:Invalidate solve result\nand demand on context;

if (Define Cmd?) then (Yes)
    :Construct domain object;
    :Write to context;
    :Return CommandResult.ok;

else if (Derive Cmd?) then (Yes)
' this feels weird , erlang being the only derive
    :Read queues from context;
    :Call ErlangC per queue;
    :Merge into demand SlotMatrix;
    :Write demand to context;
    :Return CommandResult.ok;

else if (Solve Cmd?) then (Yes)
    :Extract roster, queues,\ndemand from context;
    |ModelBuilder|
    :Build CP-SAT model\n(vars, constraints, objective);
    :Solve;
    :Build supply + shortfall\nSlotMatrices from solution;
    :Return SolverOutput;
    |Handler|
    :Wrap as SolveResult;
    :Write to context;
    :Return CommandResult.ok;

else (Read Cmd)
    :Read SolveResult from context;
    :Instantiate LLMPresenter\nwith SolveResult;
    :Return CommandResult.ok\nwith presentation in data;

endif

|Dispatcher|
:Return CommandResult to caller;

|Caller|
stop

@enduml